Drop the unconditional `contrib` subdir from SUBDIRS.

FFmpeg 只需要 libzvbi.a 本身——contrib 只产 zvbi-ntsc-cc/x11font 两个工具，
却要拿 libzvbi.a 链 -lpng。上游 configure.ac 把 `-lpng -lz` 追加在 `-lm`
之后（LIBS="-lpthread -lm -lpng -lz"），静态链接时 libpng.a 的 pow 引用
落在已扫描完的 -lm 后面，x11font 直接 undefined reference。contrib 没有
configure 开关，只能从这里摘。daemon/test/examples 走 --disable-* 旗标。
FFmpeg only needs libzvbi.a itself — contrib only builds the zvbi-ntsc-cc
and x11font tools, yet links them against libzvbi.a + -lpng. Upstream
configure.ac appends `-lpng -lz` after `-lm` (LIBS="-lpthread -lm -lpng
-lz"), so under static linking libpng.a's pow reference lands behind an
already-scanned -lm and x11font fails with undefined references. contrib
has no configure switch — it can only be dropped here; daemon/test/
examples are covered by --disable-* flags.

--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -19,10 +19,9 @@
 # Attn order matters.
 SUBDIRS = \
 	m4 \
 	src \
-	$(proxy_dirs) \
-	contrib
+	$(proxy_dirs)
 
 if ENABLE_EXAMPLES
 SUBDIRS += examples
 endif
